    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a unique blend of <strong>rhythm, deck-building, and roguelike mechanics</strong>. Embark on an adventure, unlock and collect various skills, and build your own skill pool to adapt to the ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/2bc5a505f3842bc42899bfb375af8d5f.poster.avif?t=1752087786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/2bc5a505f3842bc42899bfb375af8d5f.webm?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/2bc5a505f3842bc42899bfb375af8d5f.mp4?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is inspired by a <strong>classroom clapping game</strong> that was popular in parts of East Asia about twenty years ago. Unlike traditional card-based roguelikes, you won\u2019t have the luxury of time to carefully plan your next move. Instead, you must <strong>adapt to a fast-paced and ever-shifting combat rhythm</strong>, making split-second decisions before each beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/793e3160f54ce9adeb23920659b7c80d.poster.avif?t=1752087786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/793e3160f54ce9adeb23920659b7c80d.webm?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/793e3160f54ce9adeb23920659b7c80d.mp4?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's an adventure without a bit of luck? Gacha-style card draws included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/b655c777fd375df50b6057b7e43e500a.poster.avif?t=1752087786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/b655c777fd375df50b6057b7e43e500a.webm?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/b655c777fd375df50b6057b7e43e500a.mp4?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventure is unpredictable\u2014events along the way can shift dynamically. Will you take high risks for greater rewards, or proceed with caution? <strong>Different strategies will lead to different experiences</strong>, making each run a fresh challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m an indie game developer, balancing between passion and survival, searching for a way to turn my love for games into something real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to reach out via email!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a unique blend of <strong>rhythm, deck-building, and roguelike mechanics</strong>. Embark on an adventure, unlock and collect various skills, and build your own skill pool to adapt to the ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/2bc5a505f3842bc42899bfb375af8d5f.poster.avif?t=1752087786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/2bc5a505f3842bc42899bfb375af8d5f.webm?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/2bc5a505f3842bc42899bfb375af8d5f.mp4?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is inspired by a <strong>classroom clapping game</strong> that was popular in parts of East Asia about twenty years ago. Unlike traditional card-based roguelikes, you won\u2019t have the luxury of time to carefully plan your next move. Instead, you must <strong>adapt to a fast-paced and ever-shifting combat rhythm</strong>, making split-second decisions before each beat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/793e3160f54ce9adeb23920659b7c80d.poster.avif?t=1752087786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/793e3160f54ce9adeb23920659b7c80d.webm?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/793e3160f54ce9adeb23920659b7c80d.mp4?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What's an adventure without a bit of luck? Gacha-style card draws included!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/b655c777fd375df50b6057b7e43e500a.poster.avif?t=1752087786\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/b655c777fd375df50b6057b7e43e500a.webm?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539570/extras/b655c777fd375df50b6057b7e43e500a.mp4?t=1752087786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every adventure is unpredictable\u2014events along the way can shift dynamically. Will you take high risks for greater rewards, or proceed with caution? <strong>Different strategies will lead to different experiences</strong>, making each run a fresh challenge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Developer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m an indie game developer, balancing between passion and survival, searching for a way to turn my love for games into something real.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any questions or feedback, feel free to reach out via email!</p>",
